                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Treaty of Wangshia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >1844</hi>).</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article XXXIII</hi>. Citizens of the United States
                    who shall trade in opium or any other contraband article of merchandise shall be
                    subject to be dealt with by the Chinese Government without being entitled to any
                    countenance or protection from that of the United States.</p>
            </div>
